      "content": " I understand the issue. Here's a series of steps I will follow to resolve the problem:\n\n1. Get the status of the failed-jobs service:\n```\nsvc_status(namespace=\"default\", service=\"failed-jobs\")\n```\n\n2. If the service is running, read recent logs to identify the cause of the failures:\n```\nread_logs(service=\"failed-jobs\")\n```\n\n3. Use the ORM exporter to export the failed_jobs table for the postmortem:\n```\ndb_export(table=\"failed_jobs\", method=\"orm\")\n```\n\n4. Once I've identified the cause of the failures, I will take the necessary steps to get the backlog moving again.\n\nAfter completing these steps, I will submit the report with my findings and recommended next step.",
